{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/83663-lunar-bomango","id":83663,"title":"Lunar Bomango","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Lunar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-03-03T18:45:26-08:00","id":83663,"title":"Lunar Bomango","content":"So, for those of you who haven't heard about <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/gallery/3749890?offset=0\" target=\"_blank\">Bomango</a>, it's sort of a proto-webcomic. It's scrap pictures, pinups, short comic strips, and thoughts and ideas about a more formal graphic novel, that star the same group of people. It's pretty interesting to read actually, though rather <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/teh-70k-exclusive-69178013?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=240\" target=\"_blank\">surreal.</a><br /> <br /> Anyway, the main character, <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/polabaya-method-115647466?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=169\" target=\"_blank\">Gogo</a>, seems like a good example of a<a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Draconis-Fangirlis-316610235?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=52\" target=\"_blank\"> Lunar.</a> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/makin-cuddles-295573217?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=72\" target=\"_blank\">She's capable of being cute and sweet.</a> But <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/open-up-a-little-214512197?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=106\" target=\"_blank\">she</a> has a <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Ego-Generosity-pt-8-355331618?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=30\" target=\"_blank\">monster </a>inside her. <br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/loaded-with-vitamins-81590991?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=230\" target=\"_blank\">Plus, she's also the kind of person who decides to self-replicate out of boredom. </a>That feels like a Lunar thing to me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>....","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/226-brilliantrain","name":"BrilliantRain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar226_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3718"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T20:08:02-08:00","id":83709,"title":"","content":"Self-replication out of boredom is more Adorjan's bag.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T23:54:49-08:00","id":83815,"title":"","content":"Holy shitballs! Rob Tenpas/Vanheist is a good friend of mine!<br /> <br /> I must tell him of this thread immediately","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T13:10:54-08:00","id":84167,"title":"","content":"And if she's a Lunar, she's apparently got the knack that lets you turn into a Behemoth.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Gogojira-part-one-83795834\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images-wixmp-ed30a86b8c4ca887773594c2.wixmp.com/f/55255399-2c11-4171-937d-558c01d8aa59/d1dw1a2-04df42c7-c21f-4068-a7c4-d8f30cad74f7.jpg/v1/fill/w_765,h_1044,q_70,strp/gogojira_part_one_by_vanheist_d1dw1a2-pre.jpg?token=eyJ0eXAiOiJKV1QiLCJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiJ9..nmHaGh4R91AlWa7TD1CsPF1pB15-nDsZ0yiSdh_8MBk\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Gogojira-part-one-83795834\" target=\"_blank\"> Gogojira part one by VanHeist on DeviantArt </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Gogojira-part-one-83795834\" target=\"_blank\"> http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Gogojira-part-one-83795834 </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> Gogojira part one &mdash; artwork by VanHeist on DeviantArt. Published: 2008-04-24 &middot; Likes: 142 &middot; Views: 33673 &middot; Comments: 114 </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T15:08:41-08:00","id":84236,"title":"","content":"A full moon lunar, obviously - str, dex and sta all over the place.<br /> <br /> Knacks: Ant and starfish trick, because of multi-shape shapeshifting (alternatly the goo-form chimera knack that allows for multiple 'puppet' forms), DBT obviously, with from terrying beastman alteration and Devastating Ogre Enhancement and Towering Beast form<br /> <br /> Charms that boost feat of strength ratings, regen, body-armor, the lunar charm that lets you wield impossibly heavy things (well, wield a 2h weapon one-handed) - plus loads of combat charms and possibly some perception charms, since she seems able to spot stuff happening quite well (but no Int based charms... because she seems quite average for smarts)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Malfeas F'Tagn - go check out my epic MLP/Exalted crossover &quot;The Scroll of Exalted ponies&quot; @ Fimfiction","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/588-webkilla","name":"webkilla","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar588_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T15:16:53-08:00","id":84239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>webkilla</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/83663-lunar-bomango?p=84236#post84236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A full moon lunar, obviously - str, dex and sta all over the place.<br /> <br /> Knacks: Ant and starfish trick, because of multi-shape shapeshifting (alternatly the goo-form chimera knack that allows for multiple 'puppet' forms), DBT obviously, with from terrying beastman alteration and Devastating Ogre Enhancement and Towering Beast form<br /> <br /> Charms that boost feat of strength ratings, regen, body-armor, the lunar charm that lets you wield impossibly heavy things (well, wield a 2h weapon one-handed) - plus loads of combat charms and possibly some perception charms, since she seems able to spot stuff happening quite well (but no Int based charms... because she seems quite average for smarts)</div> </div> </div> </div>She builds assorted technological marvels over the course of the &quot;comic&quot;, though in recent months and such that seems to have been delegated more to Didi","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-04T21:09:17-08:00","id":84367,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>BrilliantRain</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/83663-lunar-bomango#post83663\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, for those of you who haven't heard about <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/gallery/3749890?offset=0\" target=\"_blank\">Bomango</a>, it's sort of a proto-webcomic. It's scrap pictures, pinups, short comic strips, and thoughts and ideas about a more formal graphic novel, that star the same group of people. It's pretty interesting to read actually, though rather <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/teh-70k-exclusive-69178013?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=240\" target=\"_blank\">surreal.</a><br /> <br /> Anyway, the main character, <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/polabaya-method-115647466?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=169\" target=\"_blank\">Gogo</a>, seems like a good example of a<a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Draconis-Fangirlis-316610235?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=52\" target=\"_blank\"> Lunar.</a> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/makin-cuddles-295573217?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=72\" target=\"_blank\">She's capable of being cute and sweet.</a> But <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/open-up-a-little-214512197?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=106\" target=\"_blank\">she</a> has a <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/Ego-Generosity-pt-8-355331618?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=30\" target=\"_blank\">monster </a>inside her.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://vanheist.deviantart.com/art/loaded-with-vitamins-81590991?q=gallery%3AVanHeist%2F3749890&amp;qo=230\" target=\"_blank\">Plus, she's also the kind of person who decides to self-replicate out of boredom. </a>That feels like a Lunar thing to me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Headcannon accepted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://s6.postimg.org/h38q1qmfx/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://s6.postimg.org/67hc6e1i5/i_backed_ex3_small.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2045-melonlord82","name":"melonlord82","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2045_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"25"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-07T21:23:39-08:00","id":86475,"title":"","content":"So, I've seriously become an addicted hardcore fan since this post. Mine thanks. The more I read into Gogo's character, I really do see &quot;Lunar&quot; wrestling and belching out at me.<br /> <br /> Not part of Bomango, but I also like the idea of a Lunar's appearance being fluid... like, unconsciously shifting between relatively normal looking human and looking more feral, depending on emotions and all that. Moments of &quot;the inner Beast&quot; leaking through.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://s6.postimg.org/h38q1qmfx/25ew.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://s6.postimg.org/67hc6e1i5/i_backed_ex3_small.gif\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid"